  "answer": "ln(|x - 1|)/2 - ln(|x + 1|)/2 + C",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "Factor x² − 1 and write 1/((x − 1)(x + 1)) = A/(x − 1) + B/(x + 1).",
    "Cover-up: A = 1/2 and B = −1/2."
