  "solution": [
    "$\\frac{1}{x^2-1} = \\frac{1/2}{x-1} - \\frac{1/2}{x+1}$.",
    "$\\int \\frac{dx}{x^2-1} = \\tfrac12\\ln|x-1| - \\tfrac12\\ln|x+1| + C$."
  ],
